Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 09:18:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(dashboard): custom balance period, searchable pickers,
 month filter, weekly chart

- Dashboard computes summary client-side from models + payments
- period: start model, end model (default last), payments end (default none)
- SearchSelect: text search + month/year filter (no day)
- balance card color: negative=red, positive=blue, zero=green
- weekly net chart (work - payments), week starts Saturday
- calculations: selectPeriod, sortModelsByDate, groupByWeek
- tsconfig: exclude scratch.ts so build passes
